What can be trusted?
Value                             Trusted after guard? Notes

user.id from verified sub         Yes                     Primary authentication identity

verified email claim              Yes, as token claim     Do not use email as immutable primary key

request body userId               No                      Caller-controlled

query userId                      No                      Caller-controlled

decoded-but-unverified sub        No                      Attacker-controlled

Identity mapping
Phase 19 will decide how Supabase Auth identity maps to TaskFlow database users and Workspace
memberships. This phase only establishes the external authenticated identity safely.
